  "title": "Fastly Appoints Rumi Oku as Area Vice President for Japan",
  "summary": "Fastly, Inc. (NASDAQ: FSLY), a leading global edge cloud platform, today announced the appointment of Rumi Oku as Area Vice President for Fastly Japan. With over 20 years of experience in the technology sector, spanning enterprise sales to organizational management, Oku will be responsible for acquiring new large customers, building partner relationships, and driving business growth.",
